    PASS  tseitin-12: unsatisfiable, so generation yields nothing and the boundaries alone carry the certificate   [144 relations held in 163 symbols]

M.5  THE PROTOCOL CAN FAIL

    PASS  a pair with opposing demands on a shared content is reported   [shared 0b110, opposed 0b10]
    PASS  a pair agreeing on every shared content is not reported   [the relation is opposition on a shared content, not mere sharing]
    PASS  a pair sharing no content is not reported   [delta = 0, so the pair stands in no relation]
    PASS  the Tseitin family is unsatisfiable, so the measurement is not taken only where an answer exists   [all 10 carry no standing address]

